      "At most three variants/two hours; no new dependencies, paid infrastructure or separate model dollar cap.",
      "Keep helper normal exit, resident tray/clipboard/operations, classified drafts, typed-secret exclusion, build/epoch validation, native Cinnamon fonts/dialogs and custom visuals.",
      "First locate startup costs before selecting a candidate; retain all attempts. No prewarming or hidden idle helper.",
      "Freeze production family harness and three-view/three-cycle workload: warmup5, visible2, quiet30, interval5. Two serial physical runs per confirmed candidate.",
      "Current-source Cinnamon/GNOME/KDE native functionality precedes performance confirmation; keep all graphical lab output visible via VNC.",
